{%- comment -%}
  FGP GLOBAL — kept as a no-op.

  These styles used to live here as an inline style block, and 41 sections
  render this snippet: the home page alone rendered it 13 times, repeating the
  same ~24KB of CSS in the HTML on every load. The rules now live in
  assets/fgp-global.css, loaded once from theme.liquid.

  A render-scoped guard would not have worked — render isolates variable
  scope, so a flag set in one render is invisible to the next.

  The snippet stays so the existing render calls in 41 sections keep working.
{%- endcomment -%}
